{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12353","headline":"陪南省诸公宴殿中李监宅 · 钱起","name":"陪南省诸公宴殿中李监宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将门高胜霍，相子宠过韦。\n宦贵攀龙後，心倾待士时。\n壶觞开雅宴，鸳鹭眷相随。\n舞退燕姬曲，歌徴谢朓诗。\n晚钟过竹静，醉客出花迟。\n莫惜留余兴，良辰不可追。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}